{
  "key": 38544,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_IGiveTMFling",
      "en_US": [
        "The only items you ever throw are\n",
        "Poké Balls!\r",
        "But is that true?!\n",
        "I want people to think about that.\r",
        "That’s why I give away the Technical\n",
        "Machine Fling.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_ExplainFling",
      "en_US": [
        "Using that move, the Pokémon hurls\n",
        "whatever item it’s holding at the foe.\r",
        "The move’s effect depends on what\n",
        "item is hurled.\r",
        "Remember, the move Fling fails if the\n",
        "Pokémon isn’t holding anything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_CatchingMadeMeHappy",
      "en_US": [
        "When I first started fishing, catching\n",
        "anything made me happy.\r",
        "But those days are long gone now...\r",
        "Now I get annoyed if I can’t beat my\n",
        "record by even an inch..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_MoreAgitatedAtNight",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t explain it.\n",
        "I get more easily agitated at night."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_SignHotelGrandLake",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 222\n",
        "Hotel Grand Lake"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_SignSunyshoreCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 222\n",
        "Sunyshore City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_SignPikachuFanClub",
      "en_US": [
        "PIKACHU Fan Club\n",
        "Pikapikapikah! Pikapika?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_SignPokemonSizeContest",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Size Contest\n",
        "Big Pokémon Wanted!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_Arc2KahnSevenYearsToday",
      "en_US": "Kahn: Seven years today, Lucario."
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_Arc2KahnEveryoneSays",
      "en_US": [
        "Kahn: Everyone says there's no\n",
        "world where you come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_Arc2KahnThereIs",
      "en_US": [
        "Kahn: There is.\n",
        "Somewhere, you didn't fall.\r",
        "Somewhere, you're still waiting for\n",
        "me to come home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_Arc2KahnPalkiaCanTakeMeThere",
      "en_US": [
        "Kahn: Palkia can take me there.\r",
        "I just need enough shards to hold\n",
        "it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_StrandedPsyduck",
      "en_US": [
        "Psyduck: Pwaa...\r",
        "It shivers, staring east at the\n",
        "violet light over the sea..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_StrandedPiplup",
      "en_US": [
        "Piplup: Pi... piplup...\r",
        "It shivers, staring east at the\n",
        "violet light over the sea...\r",
        "The strange tide must have washed\n",
        "it far from its home waters."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_StrandedPrinplup",
      "en_US": [
        "Prinplup: Prrrin...\r",
        "It shivers, staring east at the\n",
        "violet light over the sea...\r",
        "It won't go back into the water\n",
        "while that glow hangs over it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_BlackoutLamp",
      "en_US": [
        "The coastal lamp is stone cold.\r",
        "Only a faint violet static hums\n",
        "inside the glass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route222_Text_VioletLamp",
      "en_US": [
        "The lamp's glass crackles with\n",
        "violet sparks.\r",
        "Sunyshore's grid is dead...\r",
        "The glow over Route 223 is\n",
        "lighting it from within."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
